WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.430
Narrator: In a very dense crowd, people are pressed so tightly together that they can no longer move on their own.

2
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:14.720
Narrator: Each person is pushed by the people around them.

3
00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.240
Narrator: A push at the back passes from body to body and travels forward like a wave.

4
00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.150
Narrator: People sway and can lose their footing.

5
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:26.120
Narrator: If one person falls, others fall on top of them and can't get up - that's a crowd collapse.

6
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:32.340
Narrator: In the tightest crowds people can't breathe and show signs of distress.

7
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.100
Narrator: By the time you see waves, it's urgent.

8
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.090
Narrator: Report before it gets that far.

